    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should see someone eventually but i'm not really looking to spend hundreds on an urgent care visit right now if it's just reflux. it feels exactly like that burning when i eat spicy food, just happens when i'm moving around. if i take a double dose of Tums or maybe some Pepcid, can i just wait a few days to see if it settles down? it doesn't feel like an emergency or anything, just annoying.",
