      "content": "look i get it but i've had heartburn before and this way too. i'm pretty sure it's just my acid acting up more because of the stress lately. if i just take a higher dose of pepcid once or twice a day for the next few days, i should be fine right? i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing and end up in the er when it's probably just my stomach. is it okay to just dose up a bit more to get ahead of it?",
